pe.map() expects a return value from arrow function.","ArrowFunctionExpression","expectedInside","'marker' is assigned a value but never used.","'Button' is defined but never used.","'isPopupOpen' is assigned a value but never used.","'handleOpenPopup' is assigned a value but never used.","'Marker' is defined but never used.","'Checkbox' is defined but never used.","'AddRun' is defined but never used.","'SearchInput' is defined but never used.","'selectedCity' is assigned a value but never used.","'country' is assigned a value but never used.","'setCountry' is assigned a value but never used.","'cityCoordinates' is assigned a value but never used.","'mapCenter' is assigned a value but never used.","'handleInputSearch' is assigned a value but never used.","'handleSubmit' is assigned a value but never used.","'suggestions' is assigned a value but never used.","'handleKeyDown' is assigned a value but never used.","'saveCityToBackend' is assigned a value but never used.","'setSuggestions' is assigned a value but never used.","'handleSuggestionClick' is assigned a value but never used.","'handleCitySearch' is assigned a value but never used.","'setData' is assigned a value but never used.","'saveGeoJsonData' is assigned a value but never used.","'doneChecked' is assigned a value but never used.","'showComponent' is assigned a value but never used.","'setShowComponent' is assigned a value but never used.","'isAuthenticated' is assigned a value but never used.","'style' is assigned a value but never used.","'customIcon' is assigned a value but never used.","'city' is assigned a value but never used.","'renderSavedPlaces' is assigned a value but never used.","'setCityCoordinates' is assigned a value but never used.","'setMapCenter' is assigned a value but never used.","'selectedCityIndex' is assigned a value but never used.","'setSelectedCityIndex' is assigned a value but never used.","'extractCityInfo' is assigned a value but never used.","'useState' is defined but never u